  "id": "cworthy/dor-efficiency-atlas",
  "title": "Ocean Carbon Dioxide Removal Atlas: Global Direct Ocean Removal (DOR) Map",
  "description": "Model-based results from 2,760 simulated Direct Ocean Removal (DOR) experiments using the Community Earth System Model (CESM), exploring the temporal and spatial impact of regionally confined dissolved inorganic carbon removal on the global ocean biogeochemical carbon system. Contains 496,800 netCDF files from perturbation experiments across 690 ocean regions and 4 intervention seasons, plus globally-integrated DOR efficiency maps. Companion dataset to the Ocean Alkalinity Enhancement Efficiency Atlas.",
